<title>RUSSIA: Russian UES up 5 pct to $0.3905 on Western funds.</title>
<headline>Russian UES up 5 pct to $0.3905 on Western funds.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian national electricity company UES had risen 5.26 percent by 0750 GMT on Wednesday to $0.3920 after Tuesday's closing $0.3724.</p>
<p>Traders said new Western fund allocations were helping to push up leading Russian shares in early trading.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
